0,Kalasha language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalash_language,"Indo-European.Kalasha should not be confused with the nearby Nuristani Kalasha (known as ""Kalasha-ala"" or ""Waigali""), which is a Nuristani language. According to Badshah Munir Bukhari, a researcher on the Kalash, ""Kalasha"" is also the ethnic name for the Nuristani inhabitants...",Kalasha,Indo-European
