7,Kalash Valley- Beauteous Place and People | PKTags,https://pktags.com/kalash-valley-beauteous-place-and-people/,"The Kalash also have a unique language called Kalasha-mun, which is part of the Dardic group of languages. The language is spoken by around 3,000 people in the Kalash valley. The Kalash are famous for their festivals, which include Chilam Joshi, Uchawo, and Caumus.",Kalasha,Indo-European
